<task id="024" project="spaarke-notification-spine-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>communication-arrived Producer — Emit at Persistence for All Channels</title>
    <phase>2 Layer C + communication-arrived</phase>
    <gate>blocked-until:012,013,020</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Touches the shared Services/Communication persist path (email-r4 + messaging-r3 merge-order coordination); adds tests/integration/seam/** tests — meets root CLAUDE.md §8 FULL criteria + test-modifying override row.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Touches shared Services/Communication persist path — email-r4 + messaging-r3 merge-order is a coordination judgment call, not a mechanical edit; multiple persist call sites must be enumerated correctly (capture AND send, all channels) without missing one.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Touches the shared Services/Communication persist path — email-r4 W10 and messaging-r3's serial Phase-1 wave (their tasks 002-005) edit the same files; cannot run concurrently with another persist-path-touching task (NFR-08).</parallel-reason>
    <deps>012,013,020</deps>
    <tags>bff-api, api, services, integration-test</tags>
    <estimated-effort>4-6h</estimated-effort>
